  "sourceAssignment": "Completion 166 VIP Area exclusively owns vip-area-part1 through part5, five full chronological original families. The separate Ultimate Maze part7 contains the earlier VIP menu exit and retains that separate allocation. All25 VIP original/sidecar files remain; no intermission or hunt footage is reassigned.",
  "scope": "Initial NOT BABA IS YOU moves rocks and the physical flag. The first guard-word extraction loses the flag, converts all seven guards, tests a control handoff and uses34 undos to restore the STOP-separated predecessor. The later revisit rebuilds it and deliberately sacrifices one rock to DEFEAT after delivering KEKE; the surviving rock recovers the noun while the flag lives. Seven accidental UP inputs include two blocked attempts and are corrected with two undos. Moving spare IS left before lowering it permits KEKE IS BABA with the flag intact. The former guards stay Baba when the sentence is broken. A final noun push lifts FLAG into FLAG IS WIN while the controlled physical flag survives, triggering victory. Settled pause confirms166/nine.",
